Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚已中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:56.70,0:01:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼在意嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然在意了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.60,0:02:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女不可能每次都會通知鶇啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.30,0:02:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我無論如何都想阻止她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.30,0:02:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒是覺得地獄少女挺好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.00,0:02:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲被送下地獄的都是壞人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.40,0:02:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.30,0:02:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喫好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.50,0:02:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:31.30,0:02:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.70,0:02:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.50,0:02:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.50,0:02:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:55.00,0:02:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,優子姐姐和地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.90,0:02:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,優子姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:59.90,0:03:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村井叔叔的孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.00,0:03:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前輩的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.33,0:03:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}和藹的鄰居
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.60,0:03:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來今年沒來呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.60,0:03:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去年來過吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.30,0:03:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說那是他們家田裏收上來的菜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:30.40,0:03:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 又喝成這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.00,0:03:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總是這樣真不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.70,0:03:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.70,0:03:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不喝了 不喝了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了回家吧 爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.90,0:03:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 那是什麼花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.00,0:03:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是彼岸花嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.00,0:04:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.20,0:04:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趕快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.40,0:04:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村井前輩 村井前輩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.40,0:04:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會不會不在啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.70,0:04:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前輩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.90,0:04:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,優子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.00,0:04:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不在嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.00,0:04:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,優子姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.60,0:05:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.30,0:05:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前輩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:26.50,0:05:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還要再來點嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.00,0:05:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不了 謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.20,0:05:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心情好些了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.00,0:05:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.80,0:05:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底發生了什麼事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:36.80,0:05:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滿以爲田裏的收成一定也很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.40,0:05:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能告訴我們嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.10,0:05:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,優子姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是兩年前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.80,0:05:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛剛搬來這裏時的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.40,0:06:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危險啊 小姑娘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.90,0:06:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.30,0:06:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多多關照
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.70,0:06:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個人叫關根良介
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.60,0:06:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在田地的另一邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:26.40,0:06:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔真是抱歉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.70,0:06:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是因爲曾經在出版社工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.70,0:06:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對人總不是太信任
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.50,0:06:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 這裏我們不太受歡迎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.20,0:06:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喫了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:41.30,0:06:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好喫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:45.50,0:06:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.40,0:06:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.90,0:06:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇上了很多很多苦頭 現在戒酒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.60,0:06:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.30,0:06:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可真遺憾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.60,0:07:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來你辭職下地真是很堅定啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.40,0:07:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難得從爺爺那繼承了那麼大一片地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.60,0:07:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不種些什麼就太浪費了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.40,0:07:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且妻子去世之後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.60,0:07:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這孩子一直很孤單
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.30,0:07:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這裏的話　我想就能多在一起些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.40,0:07:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們會種菜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.40,0:07:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全是門外漢 可能不會那麼簡單就成功
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:26.80,0:07:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我們決定了兩個人一起努力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.80,0:07:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼我可能可以幫上你們一點忙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前種過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過不知道能不能幫上忙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.20,0:07:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 優子 叔叔肯幫我們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.30,0:07:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下來那個人開始 每天都來我們家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.30,0:07:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從犁地到選種
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.90,0:07:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼撒水到怎麼施肥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常耐心地教我們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.50,0:08:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了鎮上我們都被看做外人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.10,0:08:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對爸爸來說他是唯一的聊天夥伴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了他的幫助
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.50,0:08:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使在最困難的第一年也種出了美味的蔬菜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.30,0:08:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我現在都記得 那天的爸爸非常高興
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.30,0:08:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天晚上他說服了頗有微辭的爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.40,0:08:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硬是擴大了田地的範圍
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,結果
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.90,0:08:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今年由於天氣異常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.70,0:08:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蟲害非常嚴重
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:50.10,0:08:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,關根先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.50,0:08:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前撒上農藥就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們還沒有那個能力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是不作出點損失無法渡過這個難關啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.60,0:09:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,農藥很貴吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在還不晚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.50,0:09:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把以前家裏用的分給你好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.80,0:09:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.30,0:09:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用客氣 我們加油吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:13.00,0:09:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.10,0:09:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然爸爸相信了他的話每天撒農藥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.20,0:09:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蔬菜卻逐漸都枯萎了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.00,0:09:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個時候的爸爸又開始喝酒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:44.30,0:09:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是再問問看其他人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.50,0:09:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣下去真的會都枯萎的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.30,0:09:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事的 只要照關根先生說的做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.90,0:09:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事的 不用擔心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.20,0:10:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最終爸爸沒有找任何人而是一直等着農藥起效
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.50,0:10:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從哪裏誤闖進來的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.90,0:10:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 喝了那東西的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.20,0:10:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.30,0:10:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:08.90,0:11:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼是能殺死害蟲的農藥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:13.00,0:11:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是把摻了水的果汁給了我們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.70,0:11:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道他的企圖 爸爸相信那是真的農藥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.00,0:11:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼那個人要怎麼做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.10,0:11:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,後來我聽說了才知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:29.50,0:11:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和死去的爺爺爲了這塊地吵過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.70,0:11:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是報復嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼爸爸一定要死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.90,0:11:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搬到新家 開始了新工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.20,0:11:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想過平常的生活而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就登錄了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.50,0:11:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.70,0:12:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿到了一個稻草人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩子就能爲你復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.30,0:12:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很理解優子的心情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.40,0:12:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是不能復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.30,0:12:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇你不要說話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.10,0:12:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好嗎 優子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.90,0:12:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你如果解開繩子 有一個人就會下地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.30,0:12:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖說這樣也許能復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:42.60,0:12:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你送一個人下地獄的事實將永遠無法抹去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:47.80,0:12:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就必須一生揹負着這個事實活下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.10,0:12:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是多痛苦的事你知道的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.60,0:12:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很瞭解你父親
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.00,0:13:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他總是喜歡談論你的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只考慮你的幸福
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.40,0:13:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父親一定不希望你幫他復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.80,0:13:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不要說爲了他而一生揹負罪孽這種事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:21.10,0:13:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像情況變得不妙了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.40,0:13:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.90,0:13:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個我來保管
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.10,0:13:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再好好想想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:45.30,0:13:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣做太過分了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.60,0:13:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能收回來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.20,0:14:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.00,0:15:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:14.90,0:15:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有點兒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.10,0:15:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能那樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:24.60,0:15:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硬搶太卑鄙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.20,0:15:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能確實很卑鄙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.30,0:15:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過請你理解我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:31.20,0:15:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望優子去復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:33.70,0:15:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不理解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.00,0:15:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,優子姐姐的爸爸不就是被那個人給害死的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.90,0:15:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人生裏會發生很多事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:45.50,0:15:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裏面會有難以置信的事 沒有道理的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.20,0:15:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但必須跨越過那些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.90,0:15:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是活着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以被殺也無所謂嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:56.60,0:15:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒有這麼說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.20,0:15:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.00,0:16:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼你幫那種人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:02.60,0:16:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被送下地獄不是活該的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:05.20,0:16:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,優子姐姐的爸爸什麼壞事都沒有做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.00,0:16:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個人快點死了就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一真是個不懂情理的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.30,0:16:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一被殺了的話 我也會復仇的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:27.30,0:16:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.70,0:16:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.90,0:16:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,輪入道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.60,0:17:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇會說那種話還是我的錯吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.50,0:17:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下雨了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.20,0:17:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.30,0:17:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:31.50,0:17:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:38.90,0:17:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:41.70,0:17:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦纔好 我不知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:44.60,0:17:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託你告訴我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.10,0:17:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我該怎麼辦纔好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:48.80,0:17:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是要由你自己抉擇的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:30.80,0:18:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然只有他無法原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:36.10,0:18:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,優子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到鶇嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.50,0:18:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪兒都找不到她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.40,0:18:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能去那 晚上很危險的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.90,0:18:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:52.90,0:18:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:55.70,0:18:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.00,0:19:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.40,0:19:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鶇的東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:21.00,0:19:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:23.40,0:19:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.00,0:19:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜 你知道我多擔心嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.30,0:19:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼大的雨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:38.90,0:19:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰都沒有說擔心我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.20,0:19:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.30,0:19:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜 讓人這麼擔心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:00.20,0:20:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的讓我擔心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:21.90,0:20:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不復仇了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.20,0:20:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的可以嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:28.70,0:20:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛 太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要把握住幸福的生活哦 連你父親的那份一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:33.50,0:20:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.00,0:20:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 我會努力的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:41.70,0:20:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢一而再地妨礙我們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.20,0:20:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底還是沒讓你出場啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:48.30,0:20:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然對那個男人得想點辦法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.10,0:20:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下來怎麼辦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.00,0:20:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 不過我想再在這裏待一陣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏還有很多和父親在一起的回憶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:09.10,0:21:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你來做什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以這裏爲抵押借了錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:15.40,0:21:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,憑據都好好地在這
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:18.50,0:21:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了擴田可是花了很多錢啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:22.60,0:21:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說了不要這種東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:25.50,0:21:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過他說不行一定要抵給我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:29.20,0:21:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做那麼卑鄙的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怎樣你纔會滿意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:33.30,0:21:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前輩他一直到最後都相信你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.60,0:21:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你 你還算是個人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.90,0:21:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這個渣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.50,0:21:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:43.90,0:21:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經夠了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:47.50,0:21:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請儘快離開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.40,0:21:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微變乾淨點了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:54.10,0:21:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣就能賣個好價錢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:59.70,0:22:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,優子姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:13.70,0:22:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.40,0:22:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是解開繩子好些吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:28.20,0:22:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣優子姐姐就能一直留在那房子裏了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:37.60,0:22:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是阿一不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.70,0:22:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用擔心的 馬上就會有新朋友的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:54.20,0:22:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,進去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:58.70,0:23:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是要由你自己抉擇的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.90,0:23:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:22.40,0:23:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:29.30,0:23:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:46.40,0:23:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:50.20,0:24:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:01.20,0:24:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:08.10,0:24:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.96,0:24:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:33.80,0:24:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些忘不掉的記憶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.90,0:24:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些抹不去的回憶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:40.10,0:24:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 我還沒把一切告訴你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:44.60,0:24:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是請你理解我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:46.40,0:24:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,復仇是不可以的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:50.50,0:24:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.50,0:24:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我覺得復仇不是件壞事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.03,0:25:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.03,0:25:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}悔恨的雨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:05.56,0:25:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs20\fad(600,600)}地獄少女project/SK Per Wellthink ANIPLEX
